### Wiki links — backlinks, outgoing links, broken links
### Routes: /api/links/*
###
### Schist tracks [[Wiki Link]] connections between documents. Path params are
### catch-all and auto-normalized.

@docPath = getting-started

### All broken links across the wiki (targets that don't resolve)
GET {{apiUrl}}/links/broken
# => 200 { "broken_links": [...], "total_documents": n }

### Outgoing links from a document (what it points to)
GET {{apiUrl}}/links/outgoing/{{docPath}}
# => 200 { "path": ..., "links": [...], "total": n }

### Backlinks to a document (what points at it)
GET {{apiUrl}}/links/backlinks/{{docPath}}
# => 200 { "path": ..., "backlinks": [...documents...], "total": n }
